{"id":17891,"date":"2023-05-01T16:00:15","date_gmt":"2023-05-01T22:00:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17891"},"modified":"2025-04-29T19:30:36","modified_gmt":"2025-04-29T23:30:36","slug":"newsletter-may-2023-vol-5-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-may-2023-vol-5-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: May 2023 (Vol 5.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17891\" class=\"elementor elementor-17891\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5498be3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5498be3\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-082efc7\" data-id=\"082efc7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-89a06fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"89a06fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>April showers bring May flowers! We&#8217;ve got another exciting month ahead! Check out our April recaps and May events coming your way this month.<\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-15331 alignright\" style=\"max-width: 680px !important; margin-top: 30px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/10k-challenge-autism-awareness-acceptance-month-campaign-rethinkbh.png\" alt=\"RethinkBH employees participating in 10K Challenge for Autism Awareness and Acceptance month\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/p><h2>Autism Acceptance month recap<\/h2><p>Thanks to everyone who participated and followed our journey on social media to complete the 10K Challenge during our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/dont-just-be-aware-autism-acceptance-month\/\">Autism Awareness &amp; Acceptance<\/a> month campaign!<\/p><p>Our team completed a total of 200K and raised $200 for the Autism Society!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-76d5dbe elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"76d5dbe\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-7e34430\" data-id=\"7e34430\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ce0f40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0ce0f40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">James Mackay<em>, Strategic Marketing Manager<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> Wethersfield, CT<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Kids &amp; Pets:<\/strong> Son, Elliott (2 yrs) &amp; lab mix, Henry (6 yrs)<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite sports team: <\/strong>Middlesbrough FC (fun fact, my cousin plays center midfield for them)<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite color: <\/strong>Orange, because no one else likes it<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite musical artist: <\/strong> Old-school Kanye<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>If you could meet any famous person who would it be and why?<\/strong> David Beckham because I grew up watching him in the 90s and 2000s and he gave me many of my earliest football memories.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-496ce87\" data-id=\"496ce87\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be5307f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"be5307f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/employee-spotlight-james-mackay-strategic-marketing-manager-rethinkbh.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15377\" alt=\"James Mackay, Strategic Marketing Manager at RethinkBH\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/employee-spotlight-james-mackay-strategic-marketing-manager-rethinkbh.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/employee-spotlight-james-mackay-strategic-marketing-manager-rethinkbh-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/employee-spotlight-james-mackay-strategic-marketing-manager-rethinkbh-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2603a7a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2603a7a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/may-2023-rethinkbh-events.png\" alt=\"pink flower icon\" width=\"100\" height=\"auto\" \/>\n<h2>May 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3947cf4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3947cf4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-99895d0\" data-id=\"99895d0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a78f37 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1a78f37\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/kim-finger-founder-ceo-aba-building-blocks-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15380\" alt=\"Kim Finger, Founder &amp; CEO of ABA Building Blocks\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/kim-finger-founder-ceo-aba-building-blocks-1.png 400w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/kim-finger-founder-ceo-aba-building-blocks-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/kim-finger-founder-ceo-aba-building-blocks-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-392f5b7\" data-id=\"392f5b7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a127e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2a127e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Thinking Outside the Box: Recruiting &amp; Retaining Staff in These Challenging Times<\/h3><p><strong>May 4th @ 1:00 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>Kim Finger, Founder &amp; CEO of ABA Building Blocks, joins the Rethink ABA Start-up Community to talk about creative and successful strategies to find and retain your employees.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/behaviorlive.com\/courses\/thinking-outside-the-box-recruiting-retaining-staff-in-these-challenging-times\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get On-demand Access<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4d702cb elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4d702cb\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-590ce07\" data-id=\"590ce07\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4e461c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f4e461c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Supporting a More Positive Quality of Life for Autistic Adolescents &amp; Adults<\/h3><p><strong>May 18th @ 1:00 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>Join <em>Our Next Guest<\/em> for a conversation with Dr. Bridget Taylor &amp; Dr. Peter Gerhardt as we discuss how behavior analysts can promote quality of life for their clients throughout their lifetime through the development of meaningful goals and relevant environmental modification.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/supporting-more-positive-quality-life-autistic-adolescents-adults\/\">Learn more about On-Demand Webinar<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b082603\" data-id=\"b082603\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c9646b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1c9646b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/dr-peter-gerhardt-our-next-guest-rethinkbh.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15381\" alt=\"Dr. Peter Gerhardt\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/dr-peter-gerhardt-our-next-guest-rethinkbh.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/dr-peter-gerhardt-our-next-guest-rethinkbh-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/dr-peter-gerhardt-our-next-guest-rethinkbh-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4cbf8bc elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4cbf8bc\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b3e017c\" data-id=\"b3e017c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03b989f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"03b989f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"381\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/abai-denver-colorado.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15382\" alt=\"Association for Behavior Analysis Informational logo over Colorado state shape\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/abai-denver-colorado.png 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/abai-denver-colorado-300x191.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-0adb2b7\" data-id=\"0adb2b7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9948b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c9948b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>ABAI in Denver, CO<\/h3><p><strong>May 27-29th<\/strong><\/p><p>The Rethink team is on the road again and is excited to exhibit at the ABAI conference this month in Denver, CO. Join us for a <strong>Customer Appreciation Happy Hour on Sun, May 27th<\/strong> or stop by the booth and say hi!<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/get.rethinkbh.com\/abaiden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Save your spot for Happy Hour<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0c7ef49 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"0c7ef49\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-51a2a7a\" data-id=\"51a2a7a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8acd54 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f8acd54\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"537\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/happy-hour-effects-of-medical-necessity-review-tool-on-clinical-operational-outcomes-tampa.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15383\" alt=\"Happy Hour event with RethinkBH team and CASP Rethink SIG members\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/happy-hour-effects-of-medical-necessity-review-tool-on-clinical-operational-outcomes-tampa.png 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/05\/happy-hour-effects-of-medical-necessity-review-tool-on-clinical-operational-outcomes-tampa-300x269.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-508b9bf\" data-id=\"508b9bf\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17f1137 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"17f1137\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Thanks for joining us on the road in April!<\/h2><p>We had a blast at the CASP and TxABA conferences last month!<\/p><p>Thanks to everyone who attended our symposium on <em>The Effects of a Medical Necessity Review Tool on Clinical &amp; Operational Outcomes<\/em> in Tampa.<\/p><p>We enjoyed hanging out with the CASP Rethink SIG members at our Happy Hour event and meeting TxABA members at the Welcome Reception in San Antonio!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-fb41712 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"fb41712\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f86a465\" data-id=\"f86a465\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3886fa7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3886fa7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>May Feature Updates<\/h2><p>This month, Rethink is planning to release the following new features and feature enhancements. Be on the lookout for emails and updates in our Facebook User Group for more information!<\/p><ul><li>Improved status for client contact registration<\/li><li>Subscribe to receive Payroll Exports on recurring basis<\/li><li>Show\/Hide cancelled appointments<\/li><li>Include cancelled\/archived appts in Appointment List calculations<\/li><li>On-demand &#8216;Exceed Authorization&#8217; button functionality on Appointment List<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/rethinkautism.atlassian.net\/wiki\/spaces\/RBS\/pages\/2505900129\/BH+Releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View full list of recent releases<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-300777e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"300777e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"109\" height=\"109\" viewBox=\"0 0 109 109\" fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"54.5\" cy=\"54.5\" r=\"54.5\" fill=\"#currentColor\"><\/circle><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5841b6a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"5841b6a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_position&quot;:&quot;absolute&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"109\" height=\"109\" viewBox=\"0 0 109 109\" fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"54.5\" cy=\"54.5\" r=\"54.5\" fill=\"#currentColor\"><\/circle><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d7dca2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute